# Everything in this repo that must NOT be published as part of the site.
# .gitignore syntax, paths relative to the repo root.
#
# Two jobs: keep private files private, and keep files over Cloudflare's 25 MiB
# per-asset limit out of the deploy (an oversized file fails the whole upload).

# --- private ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Railway serves all of these publicly today, docs/TODO.md included.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.claude
.playwright-mcp
.wrangler
wrangler.toml
worker
docs
form-handler
README.md
DNS_SETUP.md

# --- over the 25 MiB asset limit -------------------------------------------
# Source footage for the hero video, already gitignored as too large to belong
# in the repo. 59 MiB and 45 MiB; neither is referenced by any page.
/The Oaks Full Movie.MP4
/Mallinson's Full Movie.mov

# The map's overview tileset, 26.5 MiB. Served from R2 instead — see
# docs/CLOUDFLARE_MIGRATION.md. map/detail.pmtiles is 6 MiB and ships normally.
/map/southern-england.pmtiles

# Uncomment to stop shipping the Webflow style-guide artifact to production
# (nothing links to it; see the open item in docs/TODO.md):
# style-guide.html
